<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx creator="StravaGPX" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1 http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1/gpx.xsd">
 <metadata>
  <name>Lagoonacy</name>
  <desc>So run down from Phillips Park along the motorway , run down the hill then across and down the hill again.  Run straight along close to the motorway,  might be a bit muddy.   At the end where you hit the Irwell turn right to run along a towpath then run along this until you see a steel gate.   Try opening it, if it opens follow the road through taking it right when it goes right to a gate on the other side where there is gap on the right to go around the gate.  Turn right to follow a route parallel to the Outwood trail, keep going until you see a clear path to the left go up this,  and then you should see a stile in front of you go over that and follow the path uphill until you see old hall lane then turn right and return to the start</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Dale Richards</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/108724580"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3488450849971461332"/>
 </metadata>
